<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1928722003"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1614556883"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="melt"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="SennaRin"/><amll:meta key="album" value="melt"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:42.127"><div begin="00:13.010" end="04:42.247"><p begin="00:13.010" end="00:19.311" itunes:key="L1">優しさには見えている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">温柔的伪装</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya sa shi sa ni ha mi e te i ru</span></p><p begin="00:19.742" end="00:26.196" itunes:key="L2">僕らが強くない事<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">诉说着我们并不强大的事实</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra ga tsu yo ku na i ko to</span></p><p begin="00:26.336" end="00:30.937" itunes:key="L3">知らないふりで隠した<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">佯装不知地隐藏着的掌心中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ra na i fu ri de ka ku shi ta</span></p><p begin="00:30.947" end="00:38.591" itunes:key="L4">その手には 未来(あす)を握っている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">牢牢将未来紧握</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no te ni ha a su wo ni gi 't te i ru</span></p><p begin="00:39.750" end="00:46.167" itunes:key="L5">優しさが溶けていく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">温柔逐渐融化</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya sa shi sa ga to ke te i ku</span></p><p begin="00:46.373" end="00:52.398" itunes:key="L6">グラスの中でずっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一味在杯中流转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">gu ra su no na ka de zu 't to</span></p><p begin="00:52.421" end="00:56.940" itunes:key="L7">転がすだけで掴めずに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却始终不可掌握</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ro ga su da ke de tsu ka me zu ni</span></p><p begin="00:58.043" end="01:04.894" itunes:key="L8">こぼれそうな 答えがあるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">答案即将从中涌溢而出</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko bo re so u na ko ta e ga a ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:05.453" end="01:12.131" itunes:key="L9">眩しすぎるあの光<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那道耀眼夺目的光明</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma bu shi su gi ru a no hi ka ri</span></p><p begin="01:12.209" end="01:18.486" itunes:key="L10">あの人を照らさないでいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要将那个人照耀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no hi to wo te ra sa na i de i te</span></p><p begin="01:18.760" end="01:26.255" itunes:key="L11">落とされた影 深い暗がりに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那道被击沉的身影 将从此栖息在深邃的黑暗中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o to sa re ta ka ge fu ka i ku ra ga ri ni</span></p><p begin="01:26.315" end="01:32.482" itunes:key="L12">住み着いて離れなくなるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再也无法从中脱离</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su mi tsu i te ha na re na ku na ru no</span></p><p begin="01:33.040" end="01:39.477" itunes:key="L13">優しさを恐れてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恐惧着温柔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya sa shi sa wo o so re te ru</span></p><p begin="01:39.704" end="01:46.138" itunes:key="L14">美しい世界じゃないと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这个世界并不美好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u tsu ku shi i se ka i ja na i to</span></p><p begin="01:46.416" end="01:50.928" itunes:key="L15">歪みをなぞっていても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便依循这扭曲的世道</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ga mi wo na zo 't te i te mo</span></p><p begin="01:51.035" end="01:58.605" itunes:key="L16">この声を誤魔化せはしない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也无法将我的声音掩盖</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ko e wo go ma ka se ha shi na i</span></p><p begin="01:59.709" end="02:06.130" itunes:key="L17">優しさの中にある<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">隐藏在温柔之中的弱小</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya sa shi sa no na ka ni a ru</span></p><p begin="02:06.307" end="02:12.421" itunes:key="L18">弱さに生かされてた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾一度赋予我生存的意义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo wa sa ni i ka sa re te ta</span></p><p begin="02:12.485" end="02:17.365" itunes:key="L19">今なら 何も厭(いと)わずに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我不惜付出一切代价</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma na ra na ni mo i to wa zu ni</span></p><p begin="02:18.016" end="02:24.774" itunes:key="L34">行けるから 思い通りの軌道(みち)を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沿着理想的轨道一往直前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ke ru ka ra o mo i do o ri no mi chi wo</span></p><p begin="02:25.541" end="02:32.135" itunes:key="L20">夜空の冷たい星よ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜空中冰冷的星辰啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo zo ra no tsu me ta i ho shi yo</span></p><p begin="02:32.265" end="02:38.657" itunes:key="L21">この痛みたちを照らし抱いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请将这些苦痛照耀 拥抱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no i ta mi ta chi wo te ra shi da i te</span></p><p begin="02:38.659" end="02:46.305" itunes:key="L22">止め処なく溢れる悲しさも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便是这无尽泉涌的悲伤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to me do na ku a fu re ru ka na shi sa mo</span></p><p begin="02:46.319" end="02:51.753" itunes:key="L23">形を変え輝いていくだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也定会改形换貌恒久闪耀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ta chi wo ka e ka ga ya i te i ku da ro u</span></p><p begin="02:51.763" end="02:58.038" itunes:key="L24">You're the only one, I descry<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是唯一 我终于察觉</span></p><p begin="02:58.329" end="03:04.658" itunes:key="L35">We've only just begun to stand by<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们才刚刚启程</span></p><p begin="03:04.982" end="03:11.209" itunes:key="L36">You're the only one, I descry<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是唯一 我终于察觉</span></p><p begin="03:11.575" end="03:18.639" itunes:key="L37">We've only just begun to stand by<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们才刚刚启程</span></p><p begin="03:22.197" end="03:28.851" itunes:key="L25">眩しすぎるあの光<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那道耀眼夺目的光明</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma bu shi su gi ru a no hi ka ri</span></p><p begin="03:28.898" end="03:35.179" itunes:key="L26">あの人を照らさないでいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要将那个人照耀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no hi to wo te ra sa na i de i te</span></p><p begin="03:35.378" end="03:42.894" itunes:key="L27">落とされた影 深い暗がりに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那道被击沉的身影 将从此栖息在深邃的黑暗中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o to sa re ta ka ge fu ka i ku ra ga ri ni</span></p><p begin="03:42.983" end="03:48.611" itunes:key="L28">住み着いて離れなくなるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再也无法从中脱离</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su mi tsu i te ha na re na ku na ru no</span></p><p begin="03:48.822" end="03:55.310" itunes:key="L29">夜空の冷たい星よ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜空中冰冷的星辰啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo zo ra no tsu me ta i ho shi yo</span></p><p begin="03:55.529" end="04:01.710" itunes:key="L30">この痛みたちを照らし抱いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请将这些苦痛照耀 拥抱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no i ta mi ta chi wo te ra shi da i te</span></p><p begin="04:02.043" end="04:09.534" itunes:key="L31">止め処なく溢れる悲しさも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便是这无尽泉涌的悲伤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to me do na ku a fu re ru ka na shi sa mo</span></p><p begin="04:09.733" end="04:14.979" itunes:key="L32">形を変え輝いていくだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也定会改形换貌恒久闪耀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ta chi wo ka e ka ga ya i te i ku da ro u</span></p><p begin="04:15.122" end="04:21.464" itunes:key="L33">You're the only one, I descry<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是唯一 我终于察觉</span></p><p begin="04:21.544" end="04:28.044" itunes:key="L38">We've only just begun to stand by<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们才刚刚启程</span></p><p begin="04:28.402" end="04:34.621" itunes:key="L39">You're the only one, I descry<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是唯一 我终于察觉</span></p><p begin="04:34.840" end="04:42.247" itunes:key="L40">We've only just begun to stand by<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们才刚刚启程</span></p></div></body></tt>